Plasma Mobile's landscape layout on the phone (LNX-6): the status bar a column at the screen's left
end, the navigation panel a column at its right end, the keyboard beside it (KWin, kwin.patch); and
the navigation panel's Terminal key, which turns the phone to the terminal.

diff -ruN a/components/mobileshell/qml/components/Constants.qml b/components/mobileshell/qml/components/Constants.qml
--- a/components/mobileshell/qml/components/Constants.qml
+++ b/components/mobileshell/qml/components/Constants.qml
@@ -52,6 +52,8 @@
         //       (the feature being the navigation panel being moved to the right when the screen height is small)
         //       => the keyboard dimensions are incorrect
         //       => shell seems to crash randomly (attempted hotfixes with just delay timers, but not great and also doesn't work now)
-        return false; // screenWidth > screenHeight && screenHeight < 500;
+        // Lujarch: on in every landscape, so the navigation keys stay at the phone's end as Android's do;
+        // KWin docks the keyboard beside them (kwin.patch).
+        return screenWidth > screenHeight;
     }
 }
